  "notes": [
    "Source and parameters are authenticated by component_profile and closure. Each field width/direction comes from actual Verilator JSON elaboration.",
    "Control register offsets in CPU bytes 0/4/8/12 map to two-bit word indices. No slave byte select: reject partial control writes before effect.",
    "Master accepts on cyc && stb && !stall; completes on cyc && (ack || err). Address is zero-extended then shifted left by two; no SEL pin, fixed four byte lanes.",
    "Host session owns all control request and master response inputs. Initial i_dev_ints=0; IRQ is native output observation, never synthetic success.",
    "Start uses RTL key 0xfed in [27:16], zero bits31:30, nonzero total word count. Runtime unimplemented."
  ],
